{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3405540/extras/0fb2e3bd09a8fb66c1011b1967047757.avif?t=1759397833\" width=600 height=72 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit heroes with unique skills and place them strategically on the field. Merge the same characters to level them up and get access to more powerful skills. Optimize your team and create strong synergies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3405540/extras/184411fcfb26748b2b490f3535f4ec6b.poster.avif?t=1759397833\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3405540/extras/184411fcfb26748b2b490f3535f4ec6b.webm?t=1759397833\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3405540/extras/184411fcfb26748b2b490f3535f4ec6b.mp4?t=1759397833\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3405540/extras/8be0400c7d22a79f68eaf52692760227.avif?t=1759397833\" width=600 height=72 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the battle starts, your characters will fight automatically and use their skills. Where they are on the battlefield determines the order of attacks and skills. Status effects like armor, poison, or bleeding make the combat even deeper.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3405540/extras/55e68ef1d990f82c8a007850e15b3bb0.poster.avif?t=1759397833\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3405540/extras/55e68ef1d990f82c8a007850e15b3bb0.webm?t=1759397833\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3405540/extras/55e68ef1d990f82c8a007850e15b3bb0.mp4?t=1759397833\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3405540/extras/17545ab9f92e3174c22bfa195a43e120.avif?t=1759397833\" width=600 height=72 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Win battles to earn Unlock Tokens! Use these tokens to get new characters and add them to your custom deck. Find unexpected combinations and perfect your strategy. Share your decks with the community and friends \u2012 and try out their creations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3405540/extras/8155bc137e14b2d09db4254edb15a499.poster.avif?t=1759397833\" width=600 height=308 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3405540/extras/8155bc137e14b2d09db4254edb15a499.webm?t=1759397833\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3405540/extras/8155bc137e14b2d09db4254edb15a499.mp4?t=1759397833\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play against teams of other players:</strong>\u00a0Discover and learn new strategies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No turn timer:</strong> Take as much time as you want</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ranked and Casual mode:</strong> Play competitive or have a relaxing time</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Compete in weekly challenges:</strong>\u00a0Find the strongest build from a curated deck</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Find relics:</strong>\u00a0Get passive bonuses to complement your team</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Create custom decks:</strong>\u00a0Choose from dozens of unique characters </p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3405540?t=1759397833","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3405540/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759397833","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3405540/ee9bed02c8f5c2dc837d9e0017a86a37ae5d64cf/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759397833","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3405540/ee9bed02c8f5c2dc837d9e0017a86a37ae5d64cf/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759397833","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3639370,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3405540/extras/0fb2e3bd09a8fb66c1011b1967047757.avif?t=1759397833\" width=600 height=72 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit heroes with uniq